- Okurr. (laughs)

00:09:55.895 --> 00:09:56.728
Spontaneous.

00:09:56.728 --> 00:09:58.076
- If I can make a guess right now,

00:09:58.076 --> 00:09:59.959
I feel like Flip is in fact

00:09:59.959 --> 00:10:01.891
having a very hard time
with this question.

00:10:01.891 --> 00:10:03.762
If I know anything about Flip.

00:10:03.762 --> 00:10:07.179
We got Flip saying #drinkswineintheshower

00:10:07.988 --> 00:10:10.168
because sometimes I
drink wine in the shower.

00:10:10.168 --> 00:10:12.297
But I cover the bottle
top so no water gets in

00:10:12.297 --> 00:10:14.380
because I am also classy.

00:10:18.009 --> 00:10:22.842
And then we got Flarp coming
in with #FlarpBiteHeDontBark.

00:10:25.193 --> 00:10:27.276
(laughs)

00:10:28.915 --> 00:10:33.403
So he's all about action, not
a lot about talking about it.

00:10:33.403 --> 00:10:35.453
I would like to point
out Flip is the only one

00:10:35.453 --> 00:10:37.716
who answered the question,
both parts of the question.

00:10:37.716 --> 00:10:39.887
We've got the excuses
rolling in from Flop.

00:10:39.887 --> 00:10:41.329
Didn't hear the and why.

00:10:41.329 --> 00:10:45.180
Did you not hear it or were
you not listening, Flop?

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:48.486
- What are three qualities
you admire about yourself?

00:10:48.486 --> 00:10:53.319
- Flip, self-reflective,
self-critical, and communicative.

00:10:53.321 --> 00:10:54.238
- Mm, okay.

00:10:55.127 --> 00:10:59.294
- Flop, we've got energetic,
happy, compassionate.

00:10:59.802 --> 00:11:00.635
- Aww.

00:11:00.635 --> 00:11:03.447
- Lightning bolt, swirly star, sun.

00:11:03.447 --> 00:11:06.375
Flarp, we got my height,
dashing good looks,

00:11:06.375 --> 00:11:08.375
and my scent, I love me.

00:11:08.394 --> 00:11:10.407
Nobody can do me better than me.

00:11:10.407 --> 00:11:12.907
I am nobody, nobody's perfect.

00:11:13.656 --> 00:11:15.656
Therefore, I am perfect.

00:11:17.218 --> 00:11:18.051
Flarp.

00:11:19.853 --> 00:11:20.686
- Y'all.

00:11:20.727 --> 00:11:23.291
- Flarp, you know what I
appreciate about Flarp right now?

00:11:23.291 --> 00:11:24.958
He is doubling down.

00:11:25.176 --> 00:11:27.712
He was like, I don't
see myself winning this.

00:11:27.712 --> 00:11:28.974
- Did you surrender already?

00:11:28.974 --> 00:11:30.433
- So let me really double down.

00:11:30.433 --> 00:11:32.794
We've learned all that
we could possibly learn.

00:11:32.794 --> 00:11:34.076
We've talked about twerking,

00:11:34.076 --> 00:11:36.247
we've talked about social justice.

00:11:36.247 --> 00:11:37.342
How do you feel about Flip?

00:11:37.342 --> 00:11:39.724
- I appreciate his thoughtful answers.

00:11:39.724 --> 00:11:43.224
What do you think, Sang, in terms of Flip?

00:11:50.071 --> 00:11:52.912
- My only concern is
maybe like funny aspects

00:11:52.912 --> 00:11:54.854
and just like when we talk and whatnot.

00:11:54.854 --> 00:11:57.626
- You want fun as well as informed.

00:11:57.626 --> 00:11:58.737
- Fun and informed.

00:11:58.737 --> 00:12:01.570
In terms of Flop, I wasn't so sure

00:12:01.748 --> 00:12:03.659
if he was ready to go deep with me.

00:12:03.659 --> 00:12:04.993
- He was going strong in the beginning.

00:12:04.993 --> 00:12:06.237
- Yeah, he was really strong.

00:12:06.237 --> 00:12:07.991
I appreciate the North Carolina reference.

00:12:07.991 --> 00:12:09.662
That one was pretty dope.

00:12:09.662 --> 00:12:11.285
- Then we move on to Flarp.

00:12:11.285 --> 00:12:14.701
- You rooted for him. (laughs)

00:12:14.701 --> 00:12:16.926
- I was Team Flarp.
- Flarp you had a cheerleader.

00:12:16.926 --> 00:12:20.014
I'm still feeling there's
not a thorough understanding

00:12:20.014 --> 00:12:23.847
of the type of person
that I see in a partner.

00:12:24.427 --> 00:12:27.783
It's hard because you can't
really tell their tone in texts.

00:12:27.783 --> 00:12:29.510
- Yeah, and it's hard to
show your true colors.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:31.840
So if you pick Flip, he'll be serious.

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:32.673
Can he be funny?

00:12:32.673 --> 00:12:34.720
You pick Flop, he'll be
funny, can he be serious?

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:38.720
You pick Flarp, was the
whole thing a masquerade

00:12:38.999 --> 00:12:41.397
and he's actually a really great listener,

00:12:41.397 --> 00:12:42.729
he's just being silly right now?

00:12:42.729 --> 00:12:44.332
Because Flarp, he's funny.

00:12:44.332 --> 00:12:45.846
- Yeah, you're absolutely right.

00:12:45.846 --> 00:12:46.726
- We're gonna bring the guys in.

00:12:46.726 --> 00:12:47.986
You're going to see them all.

00:12:47.986 --> 00:12:49.573
Do you have the answer in your heart?

00:12:49.573 --> 00:12:51.248
- I think I have the answer.

00:12:51.248 --> 00:12:52.998
- She has the answer.

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:55.589
I'm excited to see who she chose,

00:12:55.589 --> 00:12:58.992
but first let's meet the
ones she didn't choose.

00:12:58.992 --> 00:13:00.911
First up, let's see you Flarp.

00:13:00.911 --> 00:13:01.911
Come on out.

00:13:04.474 --> 00:13:07.224
Flarp with the rose in his mouth.

00:13:08.696 --> 00:13:10.530
- It's all good.
- Thank you.

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:12.259
- I just want to say, from the shoes,

00:13:12.259 --> 00:13:15.259
it was spiraling all
downhill from the shoes.

00:13:15.259 --> 00:13:17.270
My actual name is Brandon Brown.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.163
- Flarp was number one in my book,

00:13:19.163 --> 00:13:21.117
but you know what, my book doesn't count.

00:13:21.117 --> 00:13:24.260
Let's bring out the runner
up, not the one chosen

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:27.510
but still a contender, let's meet Flop.

00:13:28.335 --> 00:13:29.668
- Aw, thank you.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:33.253
Thank you.
- I flopped.

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.483
- You flopped.
- I flopped big time.

00:13:35.483 --> 00:13:36.316
- You did.
- You so flopped but.

00:13:36.316 --> 00:13:37.149
- It's alright though.

00:13:37.149 --> 00:13:37.982
- What's your name?

00:13:37.982 --> 00:13:38.815
- Oh, Lichota.

00:13:38.815 --> 00:13:40.603
Lichota is my real name, not Flop.

00:13:40.603 --> 00:13:41.543
- Thank you Flop.

00:13:41.543 --> 00:13:44.181
And that means if you
don't know who it is,

00:13:44.181 --> 00:13:45.685
you weren't paying attention.

00:13:45.685 --> 00:13:48.385
Bada-bing bada-boom, we've got the winner.

00:13:48.385 --> 00:13:51.052
The winner is Flip, come on out.

00:13:53.522 --> 00:13:54.392
- Thank you.

00:13:54.392 --> 00:13:55.642
- And he voted.

00:13:55.795 --> 00:13:57.962
You voted.
- I voted today.

00:13:58.112 --> 00:13:59.378
- Congratulations on voting.

00:13:59.378 --> 00:14:01.128
- My name is Jeptha Storm.

00:14:01.128 --> 00:14:03.251
- Jeptha, nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you.

00:14:03.251 --> 00:14:04.413
- Rita.
- Rita, pleasure.

00:14:04.413 --> 00:14:05.436
Oh, we're day drinking.

00:14:05.436 --> 00:14:06.488
- You're day drinking.

00:14:06.488 --> 00:14:07.839
- Yeah, cheers.
- Cheers.

00:14:07.839 --> 00:14:08.827
- That's been our show.

00:14:08.827 --> 00:14:09.840
- Follow us on the Gram.

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:11.108
- Maybe you would want to date them.

00:14:11.108 --> 00:14:12.296
Slide into their DMs.

00:14:12.296 --> 00:14:14.552
They're single, and
they're recently rejected.

00:14:14.552 --> 00:14:15.852
- Hey y'all, what's up?

00:14:15.852 --> 00:14:19.602
This is Rita coming at
you with some updates.

00:14:20.542 --> 00:14:24.013
Me and Jeptha, we didn't go on
a second date unfortunately.

00:14:24.013 --> 00:14:25.846
I made a goal to go on

00:14:27.419 --> 00:14:30.669
one date a month for this year in 2018.

00:14:30.781 --> 00:14:33.114
I am now on date number two.

00:14:33.316 --> 00:14:35.899
You saw my interview questions.

00:14:36.199 --> 00:14:37.971
If you think you can
tackle those questions,

00:14:37.971 --> 00:14:40.437
feel free to slide in those DMs.

00:14:40.437 --> 00:14:43.270
Let's connect, let's do something.

00:14:52.358 --> 00:14:53.725
- Hey, Unsolved is on a new channel.

00:14:53.725 --> 00:14:54.558
And then your part.

00:14:54.558 --> 00:14:55.391
- [Both] Subscribe here.

00:14:55.391 --> 00:14:56.974
- That was my part.

